#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:151
msgid ""
"Off: as cava gives it — the left channel from high to low, then the right\n"
"from low to high, so the ring is mirrored about its middle."
msgstr ""
"オフ: cava の出力のまま — 左チャンネルを高域から低域へ、次に右チャンネルを\n"
"低域から高域へ並べるため、リングは中央で鏡像になります。"

